            "review_title": "Review at Cha Ca Ngon",
            "review_text": "Taikaivietnam\nHanoi, Vietnam383 contributions\n0\nA peaceful place for lunch!\nJul 2018 • Friends\nI had lunch here with my friends last Saturday, it was a rainny days so there were only 4 or 5 tables at that moment. I love this feeling, having lunch beside the windows and looking the rain falling outside, you can hide a way from the busy and crowded daily life in Ha noi.\nThe dishes here is acceptable,and \"Cha ca\" is the highlight of this restaurant but it still missing something that makes this dishes perfect.\nBy the way, the staffs are nice and helpful, we are focus on chating together and they stand nearby us to realize what we need in the right time.\nI have had the good time here and I think I will come back one more time to ensure my feelings again.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 31, 2018",
