            "review_title": "Review at Cha Ca Ngon",
            "review_text": "HNAUTUMN29\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam149 contributions\n0\nFood OK but service....bad\nSep 2017 • Family\nRecommended by a friend we went there for lunch as we are Cha ca La vong lovers.\nArrived at restaurant we were greeted in a way we felt not welcomed. \nHaving sit down we placed our order. In 10' our ordered drinks and food started to be arriving. All were on table in 5'. Quite fast I should say since the restaurant was empty.\nSince then no staff paid more attention to our table. Every time we needed to waive them when we wanted to have something although there were lots of staff to be around.\nSo disappointed with service we left restaurant though we have to confess that food was great.\nWe hope the owner of the restaurant would read comment and improve service.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 6, 2017",
